The round_2 renders don't exist yet, so I'll work from the reference image and the current SSL code. Let me analyze the reference carefully.

**Reference analysis:**
- 4 square corner towers with prominent crenellations
- Back-left tower is significantly taller (the keep)
- Lower connecting walls between towers, also with crenellations
- Centered arched gate with dark opening in front wall
- Drawbridge/ramp extending outward from gate with side rails
- Small dark windows on tower faces
- Chunky stone-gray aesthetic

**Current code issues:**
1. Crenellations are cluttered with too many elements using relation refs
2. Gate opening isn't dark enough (no visible dark void)
3. Drawbridge is too small and has no side rails
4. Wall crenellations need cleanup
5. Pyramid element (#68) doesn't belong
6. Window placement needs work on all 4 towers

